helios.desc.remnant_cycler_desc=Slaying nearby entities will charge this plant and heal nearby Manus Avaritias and Apostolus Avaritias in the night time.
helios.desc.manus_shield_desc=Blocking attacks hurts entities, however this shield will exhaust after a few times of doing it.
helios.desc.manus_sword_desc=Right clicking causes an AOE that takes away 25 percent health from mobs near you to a max of 15 damage at the cost of 10 Hunger. Additionally attacking non-undead entities can heal hunger randomly.
helios.desc.scroll_desc=When used it will take away half health of mobs in a short radius around you, with the max of 25 damage and at the cost of 5 Hunger.
helios.desc.great_finger_desc=Right clicking will strike the finger forward, damaging mobs in its radius along with giving them Slowness. Sneaking will destroy ground blocks.
helios.desc.manus_armor_desc=Full set bonus gives 25 percent chance the armor will reduce a third of incoming damage while damaging the armor more. Additionally have a chance of giving nearby mobs Weakness, with the chance lowering the more Greed you have.
helios.desc.staga_fruit_desc=Applies Night Vision and as well keeps you from gaining greed while Stagnation is active.
helios.desc.champion_head_desc=Show off a great feat or utilize it in summoning the Apostolus Manus.
helios.desc.champion_spear_desc=Right click to dash and strike your spear. Shift right click to summon a AOE around you.
helios.desc.manus_altar_extension_desc=When 8 are placed around a Manus Avaritia along with a Champion's Head. Something great will happen...
helios.desc.champion_locator_desc=In order to bring forth your destiny you must follow where this trinket leads you...
helios.desc.greed_compass_desc=Right clicking will show you how high your Greed Counter is.
helios.desc.hand_trinket_desc=15 percent chance when hurt by a mob that is not a boss, they will be damaged based on how high your health is. Scales with your Max Health.

